{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/extras/1.gif?t=1771863671\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about being discarded just for being yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of the Lady of Strings. Thrown into the scorching furnace by her creator, she is saved by the very strings that once imprisoned her. Now, she must learn how to live while fighting for her freedom. <i>Marionetes</i> is a 3D platformer with an engaging narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b4 Navigate through the <i>Pinocoli Mobile Mechanical Circus</i> in search of your freedom<br>\u25b4 An unusual, emotional, and captivating story<br>\u25b4 Cinematic, intense camera work that pulls you into the experience<br>\u25b4 Collect secrets and hidden items scattered throughout every corner<br>\u25b4 An original, captivating soundtrack that follows every step of the journey<br>\u25b4 Unique movement mechanics that challenge the way you play<br>\u25b4 Made by humans\u2026 and a cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Born from passion and crafted by students, Marionetes delivers a </i>heartfelt\u00a0<i>story and an intimate, personal gameplay experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/extras/2.gif?t=1771863671\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200780?t=1771863671","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/70af51c91f6d46f8c5eb66e07f4e00cc84eca1af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771863671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/dd5a2df678234ff50a8b8577375964d5464270e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771863671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/dd5a2df678234ff50a8b8577375964d5464270e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771863671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4312670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200780/extras/1.gif?t=1771863671\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4\u25be\u25be\u25b4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about being discarded just for being yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of the Lady of Strings. Thrown into the scorching furnace by her creator, she is saved by the very strings that once imprisoned